# Made with ❤️ by [Vibey](https://the-vibey-project.github.io/vibey/), Developed by [Adam Matthew Steinberger](https://vibewithadam.matthewsteinberger.com/) ([@adammatthewsteinberger](https://github.com/adammatthewsteinberger/)).
# Rendered by `vibey-gh heartbeat install` from [runners]; do not edit, re-install instead.
#
# Starts the heartbeat unit beside this timer soon after it is enabled, then every interval:
# at most half the age at which the gate stops trusting a heartbeat. A user timer runs only
# while the user has a session unless lingering is enabled (`loginctl enable-linger`).
[Unit]
Description=vibey sovereign heartbeat timer for __REPOSITORY__

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=10s
OnUnitActiveSec=__INTERVAL_MINUTES__min
AccuracySec=30s
Unit=__LABEL__.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
